ily: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">융합</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">전공 이수신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">1)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21.3pt; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">• 스마트공장 융합전공 지원신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21.3pt; line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">• 교내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> / </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">교외활동 증빙자료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">경진대회 및 학술대회 참가 증빙자료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">수상실적 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;\">#</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;\">지원자격</span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">참여학과 소속</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> 3</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">학년 진입생 </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">(4~5</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">학기 이수자 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">• 참여학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> : </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">기계시스템공학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">산업공학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">컴퓨터공학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">,</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">전자공학부 참여전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">정보전자전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">전자및전파전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">전자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">IT</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">융합전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: blue; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2) </span><span style=\"color: blue; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">방학 중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> 4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">차 산업혁명 혁신선도대학 육성사업 비교과 프로그램 참여 가능자</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1;\"><strong><span style=\"color: blue; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1;\"><strong><span style=\"color: blue; font-family: 굴림;\"><b></b></span></strong><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;\">#</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;\">일정</span></b></p><p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;\"><img src=\"da